+      "classification": "DOMAIN_LEMMA",
+      "rationale": "This simplification rule adds a guarded mathematical fact about the pre-existing applyBin operation rather than defining a new proof term; Stage 1 compiles it into VERIFICATION before every positive proof and contains no earlier rule-free proof of its exact statement."
+    }
+  ]
+}

